  "body": "- [User guide](https://forgejo.org/docs/next/user/actions/overview/)\n- [Administrator guide](https://forgejo.org/docs/next/admin/actions/)\n- [Container images](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/-/packages/container/runner/versions)\n\nRelease Notes\n\n---\n\n<!--start release-notes-assistant-->\n<!--URL:https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner-->\n- other\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1765): <!--number 1765 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIGRlcGVuZGVuY3kgYnVpbGR4IHRvIHYwLjM3LjI=-->Update dependency buildx to v0.37.2<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1768): <!--number 1768 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIG1vZHVsZSBnaXRodWIuY29tL21vYnkvbW9ieS9jbGllbnQgdG8gdjAuNi4x-->Update module github.com/moby/moby/client to v0.6.1<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1766): <!--number 1766 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIG1vZHVsZSBnaXRodWIuY29tL2RvY2tlci9jbGkgdG8gdjI5LjguMitpbmNvbXBhdGlibGU=-->Update module github.com/docker/cli to v29.8.2+incompatible<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1764): <!--number 1764 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIGRlcGVuZGVuY3kgZm9yZ2Vqby1ydW5uZXItc2VydmljZS15cSB0byB2NC41NC4x-->Update dependency forgejo-runner-service-yq to v4.54.1<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1763): <!--number 1763 --><!--line 0 --><!--description Y2hvcmU6IHdvcmthcm91bmQgaW50ZXJtaXR0ZW50IGRvY2tlciBlcnJvciBvbiBtdWx0aXBsYXRmb3JtIHRlc3Rz-->chore: workaround intermittent docker error on multiplatform tests<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1761): <!--number 1761 --><!--line 0 --><!--description Y2hvcmU6IHVwZ3JhZGUgdGVzdCBlbnZpcm9ubWVudCBmcm9tIGJvb2t3b3JtIC0+IHRyaXhpZQ==-->chore: upgrade test environment from bookworm -> trixie<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1760): <!--number 1760 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIG1vZHVsZSBnaXRodWIuY29tL2dvbGFuZ2NpL2dvbGFuZ2NpLWxpbnQvdjIvY21kL2dvbGFuZ2NpLWxpbnQgdG8gdjIuMTQuMA==-->Update module github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/v2/cmd/golangci-lint to v2.14.0<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1756): <!--number 1756 --><!--line 0 --><!--description Y2hvcmU6IHJlcXVpcmUgQUkgQWdyZWVtZW50IGNvbmZvcm1hbmNlIHN0YXRlbWVudCBmb3IgUFJz-->chore: require AI Agreement conformance statement for PRs<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1751): <!--number 1751 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIG1vZHVsZSBnb2xhbmcub3JnL3gvdGltZSB0byB2MC4xNi4w-->Update module golang.org/x/time to v0.16.0<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1752): <!--number 1752 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIG1vZHVsZSBnb29nbGUuZ29sYW5nLm9yZy9ncnBjIHRvIHYxLjg0LjA=-->Update module google.golang.org/grpc to v1.84.0<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1754): <!--number 1754 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIGh0dHBzOi8vZGF0YS5mb3JnZWpvLm9yZy9mb3JnZWpvL2Zvcmdlam8tYnVpbGQtcHVibGlzaCBhY3Rpb24gdG8gdjUuOC4w-->Update https://data.forgejo.org/forgejo/forgejo-build-publish action to v5.8.0<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1753): <!--number 1753 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIGh0dHBzOi8vZGF0YS5mb3JnZWpvLm9yZy9hY3Rpb25zL3NldHVwLWZvcmdlam8gYWN0aW9uIHRvIHYzLjIuNg==-->Update https://data.forgejo.org/actions/setup-forgejo action to v3.2.6<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1749): <!--number 1749 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIG1vZHVsZSBnaXRodWIuY29tL3Zla3RyYS9tb2NrZXJ5L3YzIHRvIHYzLjguMA==-->Update module github.com/vektra/mockery/v3 to v3.8.0<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/pulls/1748): <!--number 1748 --><!--line 0 --><!--description VXBkYXRlIGZvcmdlam8tcnVu